    "title": "Downtown plan dispute escalates as DDA urges Lafayette City Council to override veto - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By STEPHEN MARCANTEL ,\n1 days ago The Downtown Development Authority is requesting Lafayette City Council members override Mayor-President Monique Boulet's recent veto of a $1 million downtown redevelopment plan. The request, sent Monday to all council members and the administration, pushed back on several points Boulet cited in her reasoning for vetoing the council’s April 7... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
